<text x="2" y="88" size="1.8" layer="21" ratio="12">WiMAX CPE Wallplug rev A — 140 x 90 mm, 2 layers, 1.6 mm FR-4</text>
<text x="2" y="85.5" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">MAINS: L → F1 → PS1.2 ; N → PS1.1 ; MOV1 across L-N after F1</text>
<text x="62" y="88" size="1.4" layer="21" ratio="12">HAZARDOUS VOLTAGE — 6.4 mm creepage to all SELV copper</text>
<text x="62" y="85.5" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">Barrier line: no copper crosses it except inside PS1</text>
